---
description: AppError field paths to Mantine forms
globs:
  - packages/shared/**
  - packages/react/**
  - apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Zod errors → forms

- API throws `AppError` (VALIDATION carries `fieldErrors` with Zod paths).
- GraphQL extensions use shared `AppError.parseExtensions`.
- `useAppForm.handleError` maps `path` → `form.setFieldError` — never remap field keys.
- Shared schemas in `@repo/shared`; FE may add `File[]` only on client schemas.
